    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Zetteler is a creative-sector communications agency in Hackney, east London, founded by Sabine Zetteler (~a decade old, ~16-17 core team plus freelancers). Three services: consultancy (brand messaging/strategy), PR/media relations, and filmmaking. Clients in architecture/public realm, design and craft. Sabine is a known voice in UK design (founded the Design Can equity campaign). Established, founder-led agency; Autonomy 5. Type Agency: a full-service communications/PR org (PR is its core, beyond hands-on creative execution). Work Status Studio (operating agency). Sources: their own about page + LinkedIn + design press. Note: Jonathan set Worked Together: Repeatedly (left untouched); existing story-nudge questions preserved.",
